model operator_coverage
input x float32 1,2
output y float32 1,2
tensor weights float32 2,2 values=1.0,0.0,0.0,1.0
tensor bias float32 1,2 values=0.0,1.0
node matrix MatMul x weights -> matrix_out
node added Add matrix_out bias -> added_out
node squash Sigmoid added_out -> squashed_out
node probabilities Softmax squashed_out -> y axis=1
